  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reverse Trade Mission - Ministry of Petroleum Oil &amp; Gas Sector Executive Management and Leadership, through National US Arab Chamber Of Commerce (Inc)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Egyptian Ministry of Petroleum and Natural Resources (MoP) Executive Training Program RTM (&quot;RTM&quot;) consists of a visit to Houston, TX and Washington, DC for executives of the MoP. The delegates will receive training designed to support the modernization of Egypt&apos;s oil and gas sector and to promote U.S. company relationships within the sector. The objective of this RTM is to provide senior MoP leaders with energy-sector specific executive leadership training prior to beginning secondments with individual U.S. petroleum companies that would begin at a later date following their return to Egypt.</narrative>
  </description>
